msgstr "Avataanko Windowsissa?"

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:359
msgid "Play on Windows?"
msgstr "Pelataanko Windowsissa?"

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:366
msgid "Your PC will restart in Windows and open it. Open apps will close."
msgstr ""
"Tietokone käynnistyy Windowsiin ja avaa sen. Avoimet sovellukset suljetaan."

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:367
msgid ""
"Your PC will restart in Windows and open FACEIT, then the game. When you quit, it comes back to Monet."
